Independent implementation

Kadar is written from scratch. It contains no code, decompiled code, icons, images, fonts, stickers,
presets or other assets from any other photo or video editing app. Its features and workflow follow
the observable behavior of common mobile editors (as seen while using them and in screenshots of their
public interface); no other app's code, binaries or internal data were examined. This is a statement of
how Kadar was made, not a legal certification.

